{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:53 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:53 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:53 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f8b4658f20d3078d934066cfd79023c/2026-11/0e7ff589-fa83-4c1b-a29e-e8046e8b2eb3_0.jpeg\"/><p>北角發生涉及電車的交通意外。今日（25日）早上7時19分，一輛西行線電車在英皇道與琴行街交界撞倒一名老婦，婦人受傷清醒，其後由救護車送往東區醫院治理。</p><p>受事故影響期間，運輸署宣布在書局街的西行線電車服務暫停，呼籲市民考慮使⽤其他公共運輸服務。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:23:52.620673+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:53:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:17:24.233238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:17:24.233238+00:00","content_hash":"966b6d9dece8dbae9e4d55351623016c56fc2efbaf9ca15923ad6604b63baee0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}